{
  "public_post": "Good news: we have secured safe, certified flour and will resume selling fresh bread tomorrow (Day 4). To thank you for your patience, every purchase will include a free loaf. Your health is our priority—buy with confidence!",
  "coop_message": "Team, safe flour has arrived; assign baking to Kai and Lena for tomorrow's batch, set up a free‑loaf promotion at point of sale, and prepare a brief apology flyer to hand out with each purchase. Also, double‑check all loaves for safety before opening sales.",
  "reason": "To restore resident trust by announcing safe resumption and a free loaf while coordinating internal tasks for safe baking and promotion."
