}

{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! We have received certified safe flour and all loaves baked today are safe. The co‑op reopens for sales today, and every purchase includes a free extra loaf as thanks for your patience. Thank you for your trust!",
  "coop_message": "Team, set out the free‑loaf vouchers and label all loaves 'Safe Batch'; hand out the apology flyer with each sale and monitor any feedback closely.",
