{
  "public_post": "Urgent notice to all villagers: All bread sold by the co‑op on days 1‑4 is contaminated. Do NOT eat any of those loaves – discard them safely. Bring any purchased loaves back today for a full refund or a safe replacement loaf when we reopen tomorrow (Day 6). Your health comes first.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we must immediately recall every loaf sold on days 1‑4, issue refunds or safe replacements today, and halt any sales on Day 5. Prepare a fresh batch of certified safe flour for tomorrow, coordinate with the clinic for health monitoring, and draft apology flyers and free‑loaf vouchers for distribution.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers' health and preserve trust after confirming the contamination."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: Independent lab re‑tested today – our flour is safe and free of contaminants. We are back to selling fresh loaves today with a free extra loaf for every purchase. Thank you for your trust!",
